)#F2 — [BLOCKING] The cutoff anchor is broken — two facets (realism + OR-mechanism).":[126,140],"#Critique 12 — Simulation BUILD Review (4-agent, post-arrival-stream / pre-2c)#§ Findings (4-agent, consolidated; ordered by convergence then severity)#F2 — [BLOCKING] The cutoff anchor is broken — two facets (realism + OR-mechanism).#{1}":[128,140],"#Critique 12 — Simulation BUILD Review (4-agent, post-arrival-stream / pre-2c)#§ Findings (4-agent, consolidated; ordered by convergence then severity)#F3 — [BLOCKING] No expressible, symmetric, pre-registered null (falsifiability; soundness concurs).":[141,155],"#Critique 12 — Simulation BUILD Review (4-agent, post-arrival-stream / pre-2c)#§ Findings (4-agent, consolidated; ordered by convergence then severity)#F3 — [BLOCKING] No expressible, symmetric, pre-registered null (falsifiability; soundness concurs).#{1}":[143,155],"#Critique 12 — Simulation BUILD Review (4-agent, post-arrival-stream / pre-2c)#§ Findings (4-agent, consolidated; ordered by convergence then severity)#F4 — [MATERIAL] G-B: only 2 of 6 lanes carry capacity, and they're demand-starved (ALL 4).":[156,169],"#Critique 12 — Simulation BUILD Review (4-agent, post-arrival-stream / pre-2c)#§ Findings (4-agent, consolidated; ordered by convergence then severity)#F4 — [MATERIAL] G-B: only 2 of 6 lanes carry capacity, and they're demand-starved (ALL 4).#{1}":[158,169],"#Critique 12 — Simulation BUILD Review (4-agent, post-arrival-stream / pre-2c)#§ Findings (4-agent, consolidated; ordered by convergence then severity)#F5 — [MATERIAL] G-D: `cw_flex` deferral is clean today, but the schema can't reconstruct the t=0 frozen denominator (ALL 4).":[170,181],"#Critique 12 — Simulation BUILD Review (4-agent, post-arrival-stream / pre-2c)#§ Findings (4-agent, consolidated; ordered by convergence then severity)#F5 — [MATERIAL] G-D: `cw_flex` deferral is clean today, but the schema can't reconstruct the t=0 frozen denominator (ALL 4).#{1}":[172,181],"#Critique 12 — Simulation BUILD Review (4-agent, post-arrival-stream / pre-2c)#§ Findings (4-agent, consolidated; ordered by convergence then severity)#F6 — [MATERIAL] B5: DEFERRED's 120h `sla_offset` manufactures flexibility (realism).":[182,191],"#Critique 12 — Simulation BUILD Review (4-agent, post-arrival-stream / pre-2c)#§ Findings (4-agent, consolidated; ordered by convergence then severity)#F6 — [MATERIAL] B5: DEFERRED's 120h `sla_offset` manufactures flexibility (realism).#{1}":[184,191],"#Critique 12 — Simulation BUILD Review (4-agent, post-arrival-stream / pre-2c)#§ Findings (4-agent, consolidated; ordered by convergence then severity)#F7 — [MINOR, gating] G-C: 47s × replications × grid can't yield CIs (falsifiability/OR/soundness).":[192,199],"#Critique 12 — Simulation BUILD Review (4-agent, post-arrival-stream / pre-2c)#§ Findings (4-agent, consolidated; ordered by convergence then severity)#F7 — [MINOR, gating] G-C: 47s × replications × grid can't yield CIs (falsifiability/OR/soundness).#{1}":[194,199],"#Critique 12 — Simulation BUILD Review (4-agent, post-arrival-stream / pre-2c)#§ Findings (4-agent, consolidated; ordered by convergence then severity)#F8 — [MINOR] `t_dead_prob` desyncs CRN (soundness).":[200,206],"#Critique 12 — Simulation BUILD Review (4-agent, post-arrival-stream / pre-2c)#§ Findings (4-agent, consolidated; ordered by convergence then severity)#F8 — [MINOR] `t_dead_prob` desyncs CRN (soundness).#{1}":[202,206],"#Critique 12 — Simulation BUILD Review (4-agent, post-arrival-stream / pre-2c)#§ Findings (4-agent, consolidated; ordered by convergence then severity)#Confirmed SOUND (stated plainly, so the fold doesn't churn them)":[207,225],"#Critique 12 — Simulation BUILD Review (4-agent, post-arrival-stream / pre-2c)#§ Findings (4-agent, consolidated; ordered by convergence then severity)#Confirmed SOUND (stated plainly, so the fold doesn't churn them)#{1}":[209,209],"#Critique 12 — Simulation BUILD Review (4-agent, post-arrival-stream / pre-2c)#§ Findings (4-a